+For RabbitMQ 4.2 AMQP 0-9-1, an unroutable publication can still receive a positive publisher
+confirm. If published with `mandatory`, its `basic.return` precedes that confirm. Inspect the
+actual exchange/routing key, bindings (including alternate-exchange routing), and correlated
+return/confirm handling at the incident time before blaming a consumer. Missing return logs
+do not establish routing when `mandatory` was off or return capture was absent; current
+topology alone cannot prove the historical route.
+
